## Workflow rules
- MASTER-SPEC.md is canonical for **spec-derived** files (memory-bank `00,01,02,04,07,08,index` · `docs/*`), regenerated by `/scaffold-project` and `/scaffold-docs`; hand-edits to them get overwritten — edit MASTER-SPEC.md instead.
- **Dev-authored** files (`05-active-context`, `06-progress`, `09-known-issues`, `10-decisions-log`, `tech-debt`) are owned by slice work and preserved across re-derive. `03-code-patterns` is mixed: derived prose plus a preserved `## Machine-checkable rules` zone.
- For exactly when and by whom each memory-bank file changes, see the single policy: `memory-bank/WORKFLOW.md` → **Memory-bank update cadence**.
